ard to and I think Roe versus  Wade being overturned isn't completely  off the table regardless of what Donald  Trump's position on abortion is he  claims to be pro-life but even just as  recent as a decade ago he claimed to be  pro-choice more doesn't matter because  if he puts people on the Supreme Court  and has a litmus test and makes sure  that they are in favor of eliminating  abortions and being pro-life what does  that matter in the end yeah ultimately  it's going to depend on who is on the  Supreme Court and Donald Trump will have  a role to play in that and whether there  is a concerted effort to get a case up  to the Supreme Court during a time when  the Supreme Court may lean in the  choice direction this could get really  bad I'll have more information about  that bill for you if it looks like it  might have a shot at becoming federal  law send me your thoughts about this I'm  on Twitter at D Pakman and the show is  on Twitter at David Pakman show let me  know what you think about this today's  program is made possible in part by blue  apron I love cooking at home I would say  that I cook at home probably in just  about every weekday at minimum and one  of the things I sometimes run into is I  know I'll want to make something and I  buy the ingredients I need for it but I  end up with leftover ingredients and I  didn't properly plan for other recipes  to use the rest of that ingredient in  and although I do everything I can to  prevent throwing food out sometimes I  end up with food that I didn't use that  goes bad and that's what I love about  blue apron you select the meals you want  for the week and then you get a shipment  from blue apron with the exact amount of  each ingredient that's necessary for the  recipes and their because because  they're clever because the system has  been designed in this way if two of the  recipes require garlic you will get the  amount of garlic that you need for both  recipes no more no less you have exactly  what you 